{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1920,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1920\">\n<title>Story cadeaukaart</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n<div style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1920px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #E3404B; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 260px 90px 360px; gap: 50px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #FFF8F0; text-align: center\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 108px; line-height: 0.95\">Geen idee wat<br>te geven?</div>\n<div style=\"width: 820px; height: 500px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFF8F0; color: #1A1A1A; border: 6px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 40px; box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 #1A1A1A; transform: rotate(-4deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 50px 56px; text-align: left\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div class=\"wm\" style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 100px; line-height: 1\">Loveke</div>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7.5-4.6-9.5-9.2C1 8.2 3.4 5 6.7 5c2 0 3.6 1.1 4.3 2.6h2C13.7 6.1 15.3 5 17.3 5 20.6 5 23 8.2 21.5 11.8 19.5 16.4 12 21 12 21z\" fill=\"#E3404B\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></svg>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1\" data-slot=\"titel\" data-label=\"Titel\" data-max=\"19\">cadeaukaart</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 56px\" data-slot=\"bedrag\" data-label=\"Bedrag\" data-max=\"19\">€5 tot €100</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35; max-width: 820px\" data-slot=\"onderregel\" data-label=\"Onderregel\" data-max=\"76\">Digitaal geleverd. Zij kiezen zelf hun favoriete stuk.</div>\n<div class=\"slot\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 130px; border: 5px dashed #FFF8F0; border-radius: 30px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center